<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Plattsburgh, N.Y., for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Plattsburgh, N.Y., for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Thursday it qualified for bond insurance Plattsburgh, N.Y.'s $3.65 million various purpose bond issue, scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
